<mxfile host="Electron" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) draw.io/24.7.8 Chrome/128.0.6613.36 Electron/32.0.1 Safari/537.36" version="24.7.8" pages="6">
  <diagram id="_1K-Es2eFMySiuZt-hTE" name="Ciclo de vida">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1111" dy="1920" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" parent="1" source="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-4" target="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-9" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-4" value="Created" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#DFE1E6;strokeColor=#DFE1E6;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#42526E" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="90" width="60" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-5" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Created&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Indica que o modulo foi instanciado.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Este estado representa a criação do objeto em si, sem nenhuma configuração&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="110" y="110" width="180" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-7" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Ready&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Indica que o modulo foi instanciado e configurado, porem nao começou a sua execução&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neste estado se diz que todos os parametros, metodos e configurações foram realizados, pronto para ser inicializado.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="350" y="110" width="180" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-14" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" parent="1" source="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-9" target="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-12" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-9" value="Ready" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#008364;strokeColor=#008364;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="350" y="90" width="60" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-10" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Running&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Define que o modulo foi inicializado com sucesso.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neste estado o modulo possui todas as suas dependencias inicializadas e configurdas, neste ponto o modulo esta pronto para ser usado&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="590" y="110" width="180" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-20" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" parent="1" source="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-12" target="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-18" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-23" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-12" target="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-21" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-12" value="Running" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#0057D8;strokeColor=#0057D8;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="90" width="70" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-18" value="Off" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFAB00;strokeColor=#FFAB00;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#42526E" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="90" width="60" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-19" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Off&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Define que o modulo foi eliminado pelo gerenciador ou foi chamado o IDisposable&amp;nbsp; externamente&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neste estado o modulo libera todas as suas dependencias e esta incapacitado de realizar qualquer tipo de operação&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="840" y="110" width="180" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-25" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-21" target="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-24" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-21" value="Error" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#BA3200;strokeColor=#BA3200;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="-240" width="70" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-22" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Error&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Define que durante a execução do modulo acionado alguma Exception&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neste estado, o modulo informa que houve algum erro porem suas operações continuam a funcionar, o seu estado ira sempre permanecer como Error até que se desligue Off&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="-220" width="180" height="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-24" value="Off" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFAB00;strokeColor=#FFAB00;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#42526E" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="-240" width="60" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-26" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Hacks&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;O usuario pode alterar o estado do modulo quando quiser, entretanto isso pode afetar como o gerenciador de modulos o enxerga.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No estado &#39;Off&#39;, o modulo pode se encontrar em 3 situações&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;1 - Quando o objeto chama o &#39;Dispose&#39; o seu estado é alterado para &#39;Off&#39; e fica marcado para ser eliminado pelo G.C.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2 - Normalmente, caso de exceção, o modulo é descartado pelo &#39;Dispose&#39; seguindo o fluxo do item 1, entretanto a casos onde a exceção pode ser tratado e seu estado retornado para Inicitalized.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3 - Há casos onde o usuario pode definir o estado do modulo para &#39;Off&#39;, porém neste estado o Gerenciador deixa de monitorar achando que está em fila para ser coletado pelo G.C. (Fluxo do Item 1)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="130" y="480" width="180" height="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-35" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" parent="1" source="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-27" target="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-28" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-27" value="Off" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFAB00;strokeColor=#FFAB00;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#42526E" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="585" y="630" width="60" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hqLjjFBJZZlb5OM9WH4j-28" value="Collected" style="dashed=0;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#BA3200;strokeColor=#BA3200;fontSize=12;align=center;fontStyle=1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff" parent="1" vertex="1">
